1
00:00:00,894 --> 00:00:02,644
Little misunderstanding, huh?

2
00:00:02,813 --> 00:00:04,233
A little misunderstand...?

3
00:00:04,398 --> 00:00:08,318
(Sheldon:)Galileo and the pope
had a little misunderstanding.

4
00:00:11,155 --> 00:00:13,285
(Penny:)Anyway, I was talking
to Leonard this morning...

5
00:00:13,449 --> 00:00:15,699
(Penny:)...and I think he feels really bad about it.

6
00:00:16,035 --> 00:00:17,205
SHELDON:
Huh.

7
00:00:17,369 --> 00:00:19,539
(Penny:)Well, how do you feel?

8
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:22,329
(Sheldon:)I don't understand the question.

9
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:26,758
(Penny:)Well, I'm just asking if it's difficult
to be fighting with your best friend.

10
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:29,710
(Sheldon:)Oh, I hadn't thought about it like that.

11
00:00:29,882 --> 00:00:32,922
(Sheldon:)I wonder if I've been experiencing
physiological manifestations...

12
00:00:33,093 --> 00:00:36,433
(Sheldon:)...of some sort
of unconscious emotional turmoil.

13
00:00:36,847 --> 00:00:37,887
PENNY:
Wait, what?

14
00:00:38,057 --> 00:00:40,557
(Sheldon:)I couldn't poop this morning.

15
00:00:44,438 --> 00:00:47,478
(Penny:)You should just talk to him.
I'm sure you guys can work this out.

16
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:50,740
- It's certainly preferable to my plan.
- Which was?

17
00:00:50,903 --> 00:00:53,073
(Sheldon:)A powerful laxative.

18
00:00:54,448 --> 00:00:56,408
(Penny:)Okay, so you absolutely
should talk to him.

19
00:00:56,575 --> 00:00:58,365
(Penny:)I know Leonard values you as a friend.

20
00:00:58,535 --> 00:01:00,415
He told me without your little idea...

